165
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

166
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:40,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

167
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah...</font>

168
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:51,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i> was killed by that monster...</font>

169
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:58,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it! He even killed <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

170
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:04,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He murdered Kuririn and <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

171
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:08,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And on top of that, he even
stole my Dragon Ball!</font>

172
00:14:08,190 --> 00:14:12,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even if I have to run,
I <i>will</i> make you pay!</font>

173
00:14:14,590 --> 00:14:18,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stupid! Stealing the Dragon
Ball was your fatal mistake!</font>

174
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:28,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So he really is here!
There's a Dragon Ball here!</font>

175
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:31,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So he's this close by!</font>

176
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:05,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You bastard!</font>

177
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:07,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where are you?! Come out!</font>

178
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who're you calling a bastard?!</font>

179
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:22,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's my line!</font>

180
00:15:22,050 --> 00:15:27,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You went and ate my fish!</font>

181
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:29,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your fish?</font>

182
00:15:29,290 --> 00:15:31,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was lying on the ground!</font>

183
00:15:31,290 --> 00:15:35,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Idiot! As if a grilled fish would just be
lying on the ground in a place like this!</font>

184
00:15:54,770 --> 00:15:57,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was my breakfast!</font>

185
00:15:57,240 --> 00:16:01,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you go and eat it
right when <i>I</i> was about to?!</font>

186
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:02,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

187
00:16:02,110 --> 00:16:05,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What about you?! You came out of
nowhere and threw a boulder at me!</font>

188
00:16:07,910 --> 00:16:09,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My Dragon Ball...</font>

189
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:14,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you <i>are</i> a friend of that monster!</font>

190
00:16:14,490 --> 00:16:16,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Monster?</font>

191
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:22,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The guy with wings who killed
Kuririn and took my Dragon Ball!</font>

192
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You bastard!</font>

193
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:26,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is he?! I'm gonna
make Kuririn's murderer pay!</font>

194
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:29,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shut up! Don't try to get out
of this by talking nonsense!</font>

195
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:32,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You thief!</font>

196
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:44,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll wipe the floor with you!</font>

197
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:46,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

198
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:49,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't cry when you
wind up all hurt, Shorty!</font>

199
00:16:49,690 --> 00:16:52,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, <i>you're</i> a big fatso!</font>

200
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fatso?</font>

201
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:58,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you just call me a fatso?!</font>

202
00:16:58,060 --> 00:16:59,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Gonna fight or what?</font>

203
00:17:09,710 --> 00:17:11,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This guy's good...</i></font>

204
00:17:23,090 --> 00:17:24,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How do you like this, Shorty?!</font>

205
00:17:24,390 --> 00:17:28,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Like what, you weird fat man?!</font>

206
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:41,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow... What the?
You've got a stone-hard head...</font>

207
00:17:42,070 --> 00:17:44,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you realize it yet?</font>

208
00:17:44,910 --> 00:17:47,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Have a taste of your own medicine!</font>

209
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:53,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Your</i> head's the one made out of stone!</font>

210
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:08,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oops...</font>

211
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:29,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I kicked him as hard as I could,</i>
<i>but it looks like I didn't hurt him at all.</i></font>

212
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:32,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>W- Who is this kid?!</i></font>

213
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:35,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I've never met anybody this strong before...</i></font>

214
00:18:38,430 --> 00:18:40,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This isn't any ordinary kid...</i></font>

215
00:18:42,570 --> 00:18:44,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Who is this guy?</i></font>

216
00:18:56,850 --> 00:18:59,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right around here, I guess.</font>

217
00:19:13,270 --> 00:19:16,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who are you?</font>

218
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:18,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your name's not Thief, is it?</font>

219
00:19:18,610 --> 00:19:20,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, it's not!</font>

220
00:19:20,410 --> 00:19:22,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's Son Goku!</font>

221
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:24,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's a weird name.</font>

222
00:19:24,740 --> 00:19:27,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So who are <i>you</i>?</font>

223
00:19:30,550 --> 00:19:32,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not gonna tell you.</font>

224
00:19:32,950 --> 00:19:35,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's not fair!</font>

225
00:19:46,730 --> 00:19:49,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you think you're doing?!</font>

226
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:52,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's the One-Star ball!</font>

227
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:55,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not my Four-Star ball that was stolen!</font>

228
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:59,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That thing hanging around
your neck, how did you get it?</font>

229
00:19:59,310 --> 00:20:01,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I picked it up three years ago.</font>

230
00:20:01,750 --> 00:20:03,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got a problem with that?</font>

231
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:06,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see...</font>

232
00:20:06,450 --> 00:20:11,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry about that, it looks
like I made a big mistake!</font>

233
00:20:11,490 --> 00:20:15,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're not a friend of
Kuririn's murderer after all!</font>

234
00:20:15,430 --> 00:20:17,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no idea what you're talking about,</font>

235
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:19,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but don't think you can
laugh your way out of this!</font>

236
00:20:19,130 --> 00:20:21,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give me back my fish!</font>

237
00:20:21,330 --> 00:20:22,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?</font>

238
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't give me that.</font>

239
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:26,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Throw up the fish right here, right now!</font>

240
00:20:26,610 --> 00:20:28,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's my breakfast!</font>

241
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:30,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, what's that?</font>

242
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:32,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just a leaf.</font>

243
00:20:38,490 --> 00:20:40,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's him, I knew it!</font>

244
00:20:48,570 --> 00:20:52,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, runts, answer my question.</font>

245
00:20:53,830 --> 00:20:57,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was wrong! He looks
similar, but it's not him.</font>

246
00:20:57,330 --> 00:21:01,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do <i>you</i> want?
Trying to act all big...</font>

247
00:21:01,810 --> 00:21:05,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen up. Tell me the truth
or you'll end up dead.</font>

248
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:11,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Have you seen a little ball
with stars in it around here?</font>

249
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:16,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Is <i>that</i> how you act
when asking people for things?!</font>

250
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:24,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it! It's right in front of me!</font>

251
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:26,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Lucky!</font>

252
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:31,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hand it over. I'll be taking that now.</font>

253
00:21:31,570 --> 00:21:34,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The fact that he wants the Dragon Ball...</font>

254
00:21:34,910 --> 00:21:37,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...must mean he's a friend of
the guy who killed Kuririn</font>

255
00:21:37,210 --> 00:21:39,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and stole <i>my</i> Dragon Ball!</font>

256
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, you!</font>

257
00:21:41,910 --> 00:21:45,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? So Fatty's friend is Shorty?</font>

258
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:49,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wrong! I ain't this guy's friend...</font>

259
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:50,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, you!</font>

260
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:54,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you have a friend who's
got wings, a mouth like this,</font>

261
00:21:54,420 --> 00:22:00,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">eyes like this, and a really bad attitude?!</font>

262
00:22:02,100 --> 00:22:04,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could you mean...</font>

263
00:22:04,100 --> 00:22:06,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...Tambourine?</font>

264
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:09,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you really are his friend!</font>

265
00:22:09,410 --> 00:22:10,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's it to you?</font>

266
00:22:10,940 --> 00:22:14,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Never mind that.
Just hand over the ball, Fatty!</font>

267
00:22:14,110 --> 00:22:17,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fatty?! Idiot!</font>

268
00:22:17,110 --> 00:22:21,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why should I give this
thing to someone like you?!</font>

269
00:22:21,450 --> 00:22:23,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What did you say?!</font>

270
00:22:23,250 --> 00:22:26,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You dare defy me?!</font>

271
00:22:27,290 --> 00:22:29,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sounds like you wanna die an early death!</font>

272
00:22:29,460 --> 00:22:34,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, I'll just take your ball
after I turn you into a corpse.</font>

273
00:22:34,630 --> 00:22:36,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go ahead and take it, if you can!</font>

274
00:22:36,630 --> 00:22:38,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait!</font>

275
00:22:38,100 --> 00:22:40,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I'll</i> take care of him!</font>

276
00:22:40,300 --> 00:22:42,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid...</font>

277
00:22:42,610 --> 00:22:46,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His friend killed my friend!</font>

278
00:22:46,140 --> 00:22:47,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So I heard!</font>

279
00:22:47,610 --> 00:22:49,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's mine.</font>

280
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:52,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll have him for breakfast
instead of grilled fish!</font>

281
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:54,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! I'll do it!</font>

282
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:56,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're so insistent!</font>

283
00:22:58,490 --> 00:23:01,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, let's decide it
with rock-paper-scissors!</font>

284
00:23:01,260 --> 00:23:03,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

285
00:23:03,130 --> 00:23:06,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rock-paper-scissors...
Rock-paper-scissors...</font>

286
00:23:06,830 --> 00:23:08,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rock-paper-scissors...</font>

287
00:23:08,330 --> 00:23:12,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, don't mock me!</font>

288
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:15,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rock-paper-scissors...</font>

289
00:23:15,810 --> 00:23:17,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who do you think I am?!</font>

290
00:23:17,340 --> 00:23:20,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Just who do you think I am?!</font>

291
00:23:20,140 --> 00:23:24,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm none other than a henchman
of Piccolo Daimao-<i>sama</i> himself!</font>

292
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:26,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Never heard of him.</font>

293
00:23:26,120 --> 00:23:28,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rock-paper-scissors...</font>

294
00:23:31,290 --> 00:23:34,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rock-paper-scissors...</font>

295
00:23:34,020 --> 00:23:35,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it! I did it!</font>

296
00:23:35,790 --> 00:23:37,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I win!</font>

297
00:23:37,990 --> 00:23:40,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it!</font>

298
00:23:40,330 --> 00:23:43,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you!</font>

299
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, let's go!</font>

300
00:23:46,500 --> 00:23:49,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You don't look very tasty, though...</font>

301
00:23:49,670 --> 00:23:53,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're gonna regret not
handing it over obediently!</font>

302
00:23:53,380 --> 00:23:55,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're the one who's gonna have regrets!</font>

303
00:24:07,990 --> 00:24:10,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the matter?
Are you dead already?</font>

304
00:24:10,990 --> 00:24:14,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Doesn't look like you had
time to do any regretting!</font>

305
00:24:22,740 --> 00:24:25,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Today's such a weird day.</font>

306
00:24:25,340 --> 00:24:29,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Running into insanely strong guys...</font>

307
00:24:29,550 --> 00:24:33,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're still alive...
you're not an ordinary kid!</font>

308
00:24:36,420 --> 00:24:39,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna eat you as <i>sashimi</i>!</font>

309
00:24:41,260 --> 00:24:44,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's this? You still wanna fight?!</font>

310
00:24:55,540 --> 00:25:00,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Sashimi</i> doesn't sound very good,
so I guess I'll cook you after all!</font>

311
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:03,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you!</font>

312
00:25:04,710 --> 00:25:08,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll show you the
dreadfulness of the Mazoku!</font>

313
00:25:28,740 --> 00:25:30,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dance! Dance!</font>

314
00:25:30,110 --> 00:25:34,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dance harder!</font>

315
00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:38,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Crap! What's with that guy?!
Shooting out weird lightning!</font>

316
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:40,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shall I help you out?</font>

317
00:25:40,120 --> 00:25:43,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid! I was doing
my before-meal exercise!</font>

318
00:25:45,820 --> 00:25:50,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! Exercise is over!</font>

319
00:25:50,090 --> 00:25:52,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the matter, Fatty?</font>

320
00:25:52,600 --> 00:25:53,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fatty!</font>

321
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:57,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not Fatty! I'm...</font>

322
00:25:57,470 --> 00:26:00,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...Yajirobe!</font>

323
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come!</font>

324
00:26:03,810 --> 00:26:06,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dunno if you're Yajirobe or
Shinjirobe... [pun on "die"]</font>

325
00:26:06,980 --> 00:26:08,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go to hell!</font>

326
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:53,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Awesome...</font>

327
00:27:05,210 --> 00:27:08,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is the matter, Piccolo-<i>sama</i>?</font>

328
00:27:08,980 --> 00:27:11,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Cymbal has died.</font>

329
00:27:13,490 --> 00:27:18,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Just who is Yajirobe?</i></font>

330
00:27:35,210 --> 00:27:38,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

331
00:27:35,210 --> 00:27:38,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

332
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:40,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

333
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:40,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

334
00:27:40,710 --> 00:27:47,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

335
00:27:40,710 --> 00:27:47,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

336
00:27:47,250 --> 00:27:50,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

337
00:27:47,250 --> 00:27:50,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

338
00:27:50,290 --> 00:27:52,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

339
00:27:50,290 --> 00:27:52,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

340
